  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#981;</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mi>x</mi></msqrt></mfrac><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mrow><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>/</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><mi>x</mi></msubsup><mfenced><mrow><mn>4</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mi>sin</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>&#981;</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mo>(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></math></p><p>Differentiate both sides w.r.t.&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math>&nbsp;we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>&#981;</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mrow><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>/</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><mi>x</mi></msubsup><mfenced><mrow><mn>4</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mi>sin</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>&#981;</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mo>(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mi>x</mi></msqrt></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mn>4</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mi>sin</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>&#981;</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Put <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac></math>&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>&#981;</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mo>(</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mfenced><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mstyle></mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi></mfrac></msqrt><mfenced><mrow><mn>4</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>&#981;</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mo>(</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>)</mo></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac></msqrt><msup><mi>&#981;</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mo>(</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>)</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>&#981;</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mo>(</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>&#981;</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mfenced><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac></msqrt></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>&#981;</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mfenced><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>8</mn><mrow><mn>6</mn><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mi>&#960;</mi></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></math></p>",
